course: dictionary
lesson: 2052
title: Hidden clues in a word
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Sometimes a word hides a clue to its meaning. «Spanish soldiers called conquistadors conquered huge lands in the Americas looking for gold.» Look at the words around conquistadors: soldiers, conquered, lands. A soldier who conquers lands is a conqueror, so that is a good guess.
explain: Conquistador comes from Spanish, and in Spanish it means «conqueror». You can see the English word conquer hiding inside it, so the spelling gives you a clue too. Always check your guess by putting it into the sentence and seeing if it still makes sense.
explain: The second sentence tells you what happened next: «native peoples lost their land and freedom.» Clues about what people did and what happened to others help you understand a word, even a word from another language.
fact: A conquistador was a Spanish (or Portuguese) soldier and explorer.
fact: Conquistadors came to the Americas after Christopher Columbus.
fact: Hernán Cortés conquered the Aztec Empire, and Francisco Pizarro conquered the Inca Empire.
fact: Conquistadors had guns, horses and steel, and they searched for gold.
fact: Diseases such as smallpox, which the conquistadors brought, killed millions of Native people. Today many historians stress the suffering they caused.
exercise: «Spanish soldiers called conquistadors conquered huge lands in the Americas looking for gold.» What were the conquistadors looking for? | *Gold | Silk | Sheep | Rain
exercise: The word conquistador is Spanish. What does it mean in English? | *Conqueror | Explorer | Farmer | Priest
exercise: «Spanish soldiers called conquistadors conquered huge lands in the Americas looking for gold.» Find and copy one word that tells you what the conquistadors did to the lands. | Americas | *conquered | gold | soldiers
test: Which explorer conquered the Inca Empire? | Hernán Cortés | Christopher Columbus | *Francisco Pizarro
test: Which disease brought by the conquistadors killed millions of Native people? | Gout | *Smallpox | Chickenpox
exam: Based on the sentence «native peoples lost their land and freedom», what happened to the Native people? | They gained wealth and freedom | *They lost their land and freedom | They became Spanish soldiers | They moved to Spain
